<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@/~cl_41> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 50 a Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.”. Pindaan seksyen 51"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@/~cl_42> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> .
