<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@/~cl_42> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 51 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (3) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(3) Any person who contravenes any order made under subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding fifteen thousand ringgit.”. Pindaan seksyen 55"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@/~cl_43> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/42/msa@> .
